  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1877c706-6e05-51c3-b3f9-4c49c2e42312" activityNameId="a25cd4cf-5b7f-5bb0-b4bf-19ca429fae1f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage power plant
The infrastructure the area used, the amount of turbined water and the greenhouse gas emissions are shared with the storage hydropower stations in the non-alpine regions of Europe. The lifetime is assumed to be 150 years for the dams and 80 years for the other material. The data describe a mix and can therefore not be used  for an individual storage hydropower station. This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Diem et al. (2008). The electricity consumption is based on BFE (2010).;
UUID: a1e9cc40-27f4-3944-8480-c5f0848619a8
Operation of an average storage hydropower station. It includes the electricity consumption, the area transformed and occupied, the volume of the reservoir, greenhouse gas emissions, the consumption of lubricant oil and the amount of turbined water.
Location: Average electricity production in non-alpine pumped storage hydropower station.
Technology: Average installed technology. Efficiency 0.8. Annual production volume: 190GWh/a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a1e9cc40-27f4-3944-8480-c5f0848619a8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="2687cc86-b327-5107-975a-9691370e3cf2" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
